WEBVTT

00:42:58.079 --> 00:43:00.337
and she didn't have a zen death.

00:43:00.361 --> 00:43:01.911
She didn't have a monk's death.

00:43:01.935 --> 00:43:04.390
She went down -- I think
the moment after her death,

00:43:04.414 --> 00:43:07.540
I said, "She just left claw marks
on whoever came to get her."

00:43:07.564 --> 00:43:10.078
And it's not what I wanted,
but I couldn't curate it,

00:43:10.102 --> 00:43:12.718
because she had agency,
and she went down fighting.

00:43:12.742 --> 00:43:15.303
And shortly after she died,

00:43:15.974 --> 00:43:19.595
I turned my phone over to GiGi
and I said, "Will you tell everybody,

00:43:19.619 --> 00:43:21.627
because I just want to lay here with her."

00:43:21.651 --> 00:43:24.980
And GiGi went in the other room
and sent texts to everyone in my list,

00:43:25.004 --> 00:43:26.301
saying Rayya's passed away,

00:43:26.325 --> 00:43:28.079
and this is GiGi letting you know.

00:43:28.103 --> 00:43:31.291
And somebody wrote back to her,
"I trust she had a peaceful death."